{"id":"562aa6d95dcc4d4d","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-incomparable-jump-inverses.md","title":"同一跳跃度的两个不可比原像","display":"thm-incomparable-jump-inverses — 同一跳跃度的两个不可比原像","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-incomparable-jump-inverses","aliases":["20-thm-incomparable-jump-inverses"],"display":"thm-incomparable-jump-inverses — 同一跳跃度的两个不可比原像","chapter":"6","section":"6.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.4.7","source_printed_pages":[141],"source_pdf_pages":[175],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-kleene-post]]","[[20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-degle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-incomparable-jump-inverses"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-incomparable-jump-inverses</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-incomparable-jump-inverses — 同一跳跃度的两个不可比原像"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.4.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>141</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>175</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02c10d5d18aba717\" href=\"?note=02c10d5d18aba717\" title=\"20-thm-kleene-post\">20-thm-kleene-post</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"45ca9c4551913b6a\" href=\"?note=45ca9c4551913b6a\" title=\"20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion\">20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"02c10d5d18aba717\" href=\"?note=02c10d5d18aba717\" title=\"20-thm-kleene-post\">20-thm-kleene-post</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"45ca9c4551913b6a\" href=\"?note=45ca9c4551913b6a\" title=\"20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion\">20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}incomparable\\text{-}jump\\text{-}inverses}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf a_0\\not\\le\\mathbf a_1\\land\\mathbf a_1\\not\\le\\mathbf a_0\\land\\bigwedge_{i&lt;2}(\\mathbf a_i&#39;=\\mathbf a_i\\vee\\mathbf0&#39;=\\mathbf b)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}incomparable\\text{-}jump\\text{-}inverses}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf a_0\\not\\le\\mathbf a_1\\land\\mathbf a_1\\not\\le\\mathbf a_0\\land\\bigwedge_{i&lt;2}(\\mathbf a_i&#39;=\\mathbf a_i\\vee\\mathbf0&#39;=\\mathbf b)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathbf b\">\\(B\\in\\mathbf b\\)</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 同时构造两条前缀。第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个块依固定顺序完成：分别决定两个 oracle 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个对角跳跃；在两条前缀之间作第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个两向 Kleene–Post 对角化；最后各自添一位，均写入同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(e)\">\\(B(e)\\)</span>。前两类步骤只依赖已有两个前缀及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>，最后一步是唯一使用新的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(e)\">\\(B(e)\\)</span> 的位置。各跳跃决定和对角化都由有限延伸永久保存。</p>\n<p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i&#39;\\le_TB\">\\(A_i&#39;\\le_TB\\)</span> 且两列不可比。仅凭 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A_i\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 也能重建两个前缀：归纳已有两前缀，重作块内确定性的 forcing 和对角化，用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 读出其编码位置的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(e)\">\\(B(e)\\)</span>，于是两条新增编码位同时已知，开始下一块。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_TA_i\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\\le_TA_i&#39;\">\\(B\\le_TA_i\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\\le_TA_i&#39;\\)</span>，得到所述等式。这里明确同时重建两条前缀，避免把另一 oracle 的未知前缀当作免费信息。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.4.7；印刷页 141；PDF 第 175 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-kleene-post","status":"resolved","id":"02c10d5d18aba717","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-kleene-post]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion","status":"resolved","id":"45ca9c4551913b6a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor